# Django 6.1

- Settings: `TASKS` (database backend) untuk job. `MAILERS` bukan `EMAIL_BACKEND` baru.
- SQLite: `OPTIONS.timeout` >= 20.
- Views tipis: form + enqueue task. Backtest tidak di view.
- Enqueue setelah commit: `transaction.on_commit(lambda: enqueue_run.enqueue(run_id=...))`.
- Semua halaman app: `login_required`.
- Apps: `apps.core`, `marketdata`, `strategies`, `backtests`, `reports`.

```python
# BAD
def create_run(request):
    run_backtest(df)  # blocking

# GOOD
run = BacktestRun.objects.create(status="queued", ...)
transaction.on_commit(lambda: enqueue_run.enqueue(run_id=run.pk))
```
